From: jetbee <7734987+jetbee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] SystemServiceRegistry: register the A6L "epd" E-ink
 service

Context.getSystemService("epd") returns a com.hmct.epd.EpdManager
wrapping the "epd" binder, published by the E-ink service app of
hk-hisense-a6l-eink. The manager class lives in the com.hmct.epd boot jar, so
the cached fetcher reaches it by reflection; a missing binder or class
is reported as "service not found" and the caller gets null. The
registration is unconditional (the stock ro.hmct.epd.support gate is
not checked here).

Implemented from cleanroom specs 01-com.hmct.epd.md and
02-epd-service.md (section 5.2).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
